---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <div class="footer-logo">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M32 8 L52 48 L12 48 Z" fill="#38bdf8" opacity="0.9" />
          <path d="M32 8 L32 48 L12 48 Z" fill="#fff" opacity="0.5" />
        </svg>
        <span>Prism AI 棱镜</span>
      </div>
      <p class="footer-slogan">折射 AI 的每一束光，照见高效学习的路径。</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="外部链接">
      <a href="https://github.com/pureedgelk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        GitHub 主页
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/pureedgelk/prism-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        源代码仓库
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/pureedgelk/prism-ai/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        问题反馈
      </a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <span>© {year} Prism AI Contributors · 基于 MIT 协议开源</span>
    <span>内容持续更新中，欢迎共建</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: 5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .footer-slogan {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: var(--color-ink-700);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--color-ice-700);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem 1.8rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.14);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    color: var(--color-ink-400);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }
</style>
